							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-3.5 bg-base-200/80 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 border border-base-300">
							<span class="font-bold text-base-content">Agent Winning Talk-Track:</span>
							<p class="text-xs text-base-content/90 font-medium leading-relaxed" id="bc-response">
								"Pivot to Total Cost of Ownership (TCO). While our upfront subscription is higher, LegacyVendor requires 2 dedicated FTEs just to maintain manual data sync. We automate that workflow entirely, delivering an $80k net savings in Year 1."
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px]" id="bc-tags">
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-outline">TCO Comparison</span>
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-outline">$80k Net Savings</span>
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-outline">60-day break-even</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Deliverable Card 2: Live MAP Roadmap -->
					<div id="live-map-card" class="card bg-base-100 border-2 border-base-300 shadow-sm p-5 space-y-3">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2.5">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-base-200 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">🗺️</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-base-content" id="map-title">Mutual Action Plan (MAP)</h4>
							</div>
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-warning font-semibold" id="map-badge">Stage 3 / 6 Active</span>
						</div>
						<div class="space-y-1">
							<span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-base-content/60">Current Active Stage:</span>
							<div class="font-bold text-sm text-base-content" id="map-stage-name">Security & InfoSec Compliance</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-base-content/75 font-medium" id="map-stage-desc">
								SOC2 Type II audit review and zero retention verification (Target: This Thursday).
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
							<div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-base-200 border border-base-300">
								<span class="text-base-content/60 text-[11px]">Next Milestone:</span>
								<div class="font-bold text-base-content" id="map-next">Legal MSA Review</div>
							</div>
							<div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-base-200 border border-base-300">
								<span class="text-base-content/60 text-[11px]">Target Close:</span>
								<div class="font-bold text-base-content font-mono" id="map-close">Oct 28, 2026</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Deliverable Card 3: Live Executive Email -->
					<div id="live-email-card" class="card bg-base-100 border-2 border-base-300 shadow-sm p-5 space-y-3">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2.5">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-base-200 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">✉️</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-base-content" id="email-title">Executive Proposal Email</h4>
							</div>
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-success font-semibold" id="email-badge">Draft Ready</span>
						</div>
						<div class="space-y-1">
							<div class="text-xs font-bold text-base-content flex items-center justify-between">
								<span id="email-subject-line">Executive Summary & Next Steps — BUST x ACME Corp</span>
								<button id="btn-copy-live-email" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">Copy Text</button>
							</div>
							<pre class="p-3.5 bg-base-200/80 rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] text-base-content leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap border border-base-300" id="email-body-content">Hi Sarah,

Following our technical discovery, BUST will enable your enterprise sales team to automate battlecard preparation and collateral synthesis.

Key next steps from our Mutual Action Plan:
1. Security & Compliance: SOC2 Type II audit review targeted for completion this Thursday.
2. Competitive Battlecards: Tailored objection talk-tracks prepared for your reps.
3. Commercial Terms: $120k/yr annual contract with break-even achieved within 60 days.

Looking forward to our sync next week.

Best regards,
Alex Morgan | Strategic Accounts</pre>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Deliverable Card 4: Live Hotel Suite Keycard -->
					<div id="live-suite-card" class="card bg-base-100 border-2 border-primary/40 shadow-sm p-5 space-y-3">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2.5">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-base-200 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">🏨</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-base-content" id="suite-title">Buyer Deal Suite & Digital Keycard</h4>
							</div>
							<span class="badge badge-xs badge-success font-semibold" id="suite-badge">Keycard Active</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 p-3 bg-base-200/90 rounded-xl border border-base-300">
							<div>
								<span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-base-content/60 font-bold" id="suite-token-text">Keycard Pass: suite_acmecorp_91f404</span>
								<div class="font-bold text-xs text-base-content" id="suite-name-text">Penthouse Suite: ACME Corp</div>
							</div>
							<a id="btn-enter-suite" href="/suite/suite_acmecorp_91f404" target="_blank" class="btn btn-xs btn-neutral font-semibold">
								Enter Suite As Guest 🚪
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Agent Reasoning & Plan Steps (Hidden by default, shown on demand) -->
		<section id="agent-reasoning-panel" class="hidden card bg-base-100 border-2 border-base-300 shadow-md w-full">
			<div class="card-body p-6 space-y-4">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-3">
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-base-content">Agent Execution Plan & Chain of Thought</h3>
						<p class="text-xs text-base-content/70">Autonomous tool dispatch and schema validation logs</p>
					</div>
					<span id="reasoning-status-badge" class="badge badge-xs badge-neutral">Standby</span>
				</div>

				<div class="space-y-1.5 pt-1">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold text-base-content/80">Real-Time Telemetry Log:</span>
					<pre id="agent-trace-log" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200 border border-base-300 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap min-h-16 text-base-content font-semibold">Direct the agent via chat to observe autonomous tool dispatching.</pre>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>

	<script>
		// Chat DOM elements
		const chatForm = document.getElementById('chat-form');
		const chatInput = document.getElementById('chat-input') as HTMLInputElement;
		const chatContainer = document.getElementById('chat-messages-container');
		const sendBtn = document.getElementById('btn-send-chat');
		const clearBtn = document.getElementById('btn-clear-chat');
		const chips = document.querySelectorAll('.chat-chip');
		const activeAccountBadge = document.getElementById('active-account-badge');
		const agentStatusBadge = document.getElementById('agent-status-badge');
		const traceLog = document.getElementById('agent-trace-log');
		const reasoningToggleBtn = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-reasoning');
		const reasoningToggleText = document.getElementById('reasoning-toggle-text');
		const reasoningPanel = document.getElementById('agent-reasoning-panel');
		const reasoningBadge = document.getElementById('reasoning-status-badge');

		// Deliverable Cards DOM elements
		const bcQuote = document.getElementById('bc-quote');
		const bcResponse = document.getElementById('bc-response');
		const bcTitle = document.getElementById('bc-title');
		const bcTags = document.getElementById('bc-tags');

		const mapStageName = document.getElementById('map-stage-name');
		const mapStageDesc = document.getElementById('map-stage-desc');
		const mapNext = document.getElementById('map-next');
		const mapClose = document.getElementById('map-close');

		const emailSubject = document.getElementById('email-subject-line');
		const emailBody = document.getElementById('email-body-content');
		const copyEmailBtn = document.getElementById('btn-copy-live-email');

		const suiteTokenText = document.getElementById('suite-token-text');
		const suiteNameText = document.getElementById('suite-name-text');
		const enterSuiteBtn = document.getElementById('btn-enter-suite') as HTMLAnchorElement;

		let currentDealContext = {
			account_name: 'ACME Corp',
			deal_size: '$150,000 ARR',
			competitor: 'LegacyVendor',
			recipient: 'Sarah Jenkins (VP Sales Ops)',
		};

		// 1. Append message to chat container
		function appendMessage(role: 'user' | 'agent', text: string, tools: string[] = []) {
			if (!chatContainer) return;
			const msgDiv = document.createElement('div');
			msgDiv.className = role === 'user' ? 'chat chat-end' : 'chat chat-start';

			let toolsHtml = '';
			if (tools.length > 0) {
				toolsHtml = `
					<div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-base-300/80 flex flex-wrap gap-1">
						${tools.map((t) => `<span class="badge badge-xs badge-success font-semibold">✓ ${t}</span>`).join('')}
					</div>
				`;
			}

			const bubbleBg = role === 'user' ? 'bg-primary text-primary-content font-medium' : 'bg-base-200 text-base-content border border-base-300/80';

			msgDiv.innerHTML = `
				<div class="chat-bubble ${bubbleBg} text-xs p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-2xs leading-relaxed max-w-[85%]">
					<div>${text}</div>
					${toolsHtml}
				</div>
			`;
			chatContainer.appendChild(msgDiv);
			chatContainer.scrollTop = chatContainer.scrollHeight;
		}

		// 2. Send directive to live agent endpoint
		async function sendDirective(promptText: string) {
			if (!promptText) return;
			appendMessage('user', promptText);

			if (sendBtn) (sendBtn as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = true;
			if (agentStatusBadge) {
				agentStatusBadge.className = 'badge badge-sm badge-warning font-semibold';
				agentStatusBadge.textContent = 'Agent Executing...';
			}
			if (reasoningBadge) reasoningBadge.textContent = 'Active Execution';
			if (traceLog) {
				traceLog.textContent = `[Agent] Received directive: "${promptText}"\n[Pipeline] Analyzing intent & dispatching tools...`;
			}

			try {
				const res = await fetch('/api/agent/chat', {
					method: 'POST',
					headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
					body: JSON.stringify({
						message: promptText,
						deal_context: currentDealContext,
					}),
				});

				const data = await res.json();
				if (res.ok && data.status === 'success') {
					appendMessage('agent', data.agent_reply, data.actions_taken || []);

					// Update context
					if (data.deal_context) {
						currentDealContext = { ...currentDealContext, ...data.deal_context };
						if (activeAccountBadge) {
							activeAccountBadge.textContent = `Account: ${currentDealContext.account_name}`;
						}
					}

					// Update Live Deliverables if returned
					const arts = data.artifacts || {};

					// Battlecards
					if (arts.battlecards?.content?.cards?.[0]) {
						const card = arts.battlecards.content.cards[0];
						if (bcTitle) bcTitle.textContent = arts.battlecards.title;
						if (bcQuote) bcQuote.textContent = `"${card.objection_quote}"`;
						if (bcResponse) bcResponse.textContent = card.winning_response;
						if (bcTags && card.tags) {
							bcTags.innerHTML = card.tags.map((t: string) => `<span class="badge badge-xs badge-outline">${t}</span>`).join('');
						}
					}

					// MAP Roadmap
					if (arts.flowchart?.content) {
						const fc = arts.flowchart.content;
						const curr = fc.stages?.find((s: any) => s.status === 'current') || fc.stages?.[2];
						if (curr) {
							if (mapStageName) mapStageName.textContent = curr.name;
							if (mapStageDesc) mapStageDesc.textContent = curr.description;
						}
						if (mapClose) mapClose.textContent = fc.target_close_date || 'Oct 28, 2026';
					}

					// Email
					if (arts.email?.content) {
						const em = arts.email.content;
						if (emailSubject) emailSubject.textContent = em.subject;
						if (emailBody) emailBody.textContent = em.body;
					}

					// Suite Keycard
					if (arts.suite) {
						if (suiteTokenText) suiteTokenText.textContent = `Keycard Pass: ${arts.suite.share_id}`;
						if (suiteNameText) suiteNameText.textContent = arts.suite.suite_name;
						if (enterSuiteBtn) enterSuiteBtn.href = arts.suite.access_url;
					}

					if (traceLog) {
						traceLog.textContent = `Directive completed successfully.\nActions Taken: ${data.actions_taken?.join(', ')}\nContext: ${JSON.stringify(currentDealContext, null, 2)}`;
					}
				} else {
					appendMessage('agent', `I encountered an issue executing that directive: ${data.detail || 'Internal error'}`);
				}
			} catch (err: any) {
				appendMessage('agent', `Connection error: ${err.message}`);
			} finally {
				if (sendBtn) (sendBtn as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = false;
				if (agentStatusBadge) {
					agentStatusBadge.className = 'badge badge-sm badge-success font-semibold';
					agentStatusBadge.textContent = 'Agent Online';
				}
			}
		}

		// Chat submit listener
		chatForm?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
			e.preventDefault();
			const val = (chatInput?.value || '').trim();
			if (!val) return;
			chatInput.value = '';
			sendDirective(val);
		});

		// Quick chip buttons
		chips.forEach((chip) => {
			chip.addEventListener('click', () => {
				const p = chip.getAttribute('data-prompt');
				if (p) sendDirective(p);
			});
		});

		// Copy email text
		copyEmailBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			if (!emailBody) return;
			navigator.clipboard.writeText(emailBody.textContent || '').then(() => {
				const orig = copyEmailBtn.textContent;
				copyEmailBtn.textContent = 'Copied! ✓';
				setTimeout(() => (copyEmailBtn.textContent = orig), 2000);
			});
		});

		// Clear chat
		clearBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			if (chatContainer) {
				chatContainer.innerHTML = `
					<div class="chat chat-start">
						<div class="chat-bubble bg-base-200 text-base-content text-xs p-3.5 leading-relaxed rounded-2xl border border-base-300/80 shadow-2xs">
							<p class="font-semibold mb-1">Agent reset.</p>
							<p class="text-base-content/85">Tell me what deal you'd like to work on.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				`;
			}
		});

		// Toggle Agent Reasoning View
		let isReasoningVisible = false;
		reasoningToggleBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			isReasoningVisible = !isReasoningVisible;
			if (reasoningPanel) reasoningPanel.classList.toggle('hidden', !isReasoningVisible);
			if (reasoningToggleText) {
				reasoningToggleText.textContent = isReasoningVisible ? 'Hide Agent Reasoning & Steps' : 'Show Agent Reasoning & Steps';
			}
		});

		// Deliverable tab filters
		const dTabs = document.querySelectorAll('.deliverable-tab');
		dTabs.forEach((tab) => {
			tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
				const v = tab.getAttribute('data-view');
				dTabs.forEach((t) => {
					t.classList.remove('btn-neutral');
					t.classList.add('btn-ghost', 'text-base-content/75');
				});
				tab.classList.add('btn-neutral');
				tab.classList.remove('btn-ghost', 'text-base-content/75');

				const cards = {
					battlecards: document.getElementById('live-battlecards-card'),
					roadmap: document.getElementById('live-map-card'),
					email: document.getElementById('live-email-card'),
					suite: document.getElementById('live-suite-card'),
				};

				if (v === 'all') {
					Object.values(cards).forEach((c) => c?.classList.remove('hidden'));
				} else {
					Object.entries(cards).forEach(([key, card]) => {
						if (key === v) {
							card?.classList.remove('hidden');
						} else {
							card?.classList.add('hidden');
						}
					});
				}
			});
		});
	</script>
</Layout>

